message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyunjeon (동현전): a single-player turn-based strategy simulation laboratory against the computer, set up through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.2"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
authors:
